sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Owner A (fence 1)
  participant R as Redis
  participant B as Instance B
  participant PG as Postgres
  Note over A: docker pause, and A's Redis<br/>route cut
  Note over R: lease expires
  B->>R: fence 2, lease
  B->>PG: UPDATE boards SET fence = 2
  B->>B: serving
  Note over A: unpaused: requests queued in<br/>its socket
  A->>R: renew lease (fails: Redis<br/>unreachable, A keeps<br/>serving)
  A->>PG: commit WHERE fence = 1
  PG-->>A: 0 rows
  A->>A: ALERT fenced out, NOT_OWNER,<br/>close (nothing stored,<br/>nothing broadcast)
